<h3>One field of the key</h3>
{albums $album_id=9}<p>{$title}, {$released}</p>{/albums}

<h3>Both fields of a key of two</h3>
{tracks $album_id=3, $track_no=2}<p>Track {$track_no} of album {$album_id}: {$title}</p>{/tracks}

<h3>The first field alone: every row it names</h3>
<ol>
  {tracks $album_id=3}<li>{$title}</li>{/tracks}
</ol>
